@startuml autonomous-offering-execution-boundary
title Autonomous Offering Execution Boundary ; per ADR-ES-019 section 5 + CR-ES-019 section 3

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

start
:Offering Objective;
:Offering Context;
:Sense / Assess;
:Decision;
:Configuration / Composition;
:Action / Coordination;
:Fulfillment;
:Observe Outcome;
if (Adapt?) then (yes)
  :Adapt;
elseif (Escalate?) then (yes)
  :Escalate;
endif

stop

note right
  Per ADR-ES-019 section 7, the entire offering does NOT need
  to operate autonomously. Mixed realization permitted.
end note

@enduml
